{"ID":"20240205170443-9pfvzkb","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205170443-9pfvzkb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170443-9pfvzkb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170654-hkt2b9e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611110251-y88jz96\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2075,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611111212-p9o7b91\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"140瓜蒂（甜瓜蒂）","type":"doc","updated":"20240812175345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205170654-hkt2b9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170654-hkt2b9e","updated":"20240812173222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓜蔕"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓜蔕-20240205170654-6a90x1b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240621144624-77om5gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621144624-77om5gv","updated":"20240812173607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 456px;","style":"width: 446px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 1-20240812173458-7chf7as.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 446px;\" parent-style=\"width: 456px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 679px;","style":"width: 669px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621144531-5zgwn3u.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 669px;\" parent-style=\"width: 679px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812173415-dlqmzoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812173415-dlqmzoo","updated":"20240812173545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜-20240812173415-b77ds5v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 2-20240812173545-ytjzeq8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812173828-j0yv2m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812173828-j0yv2m5","updated":"20240812174708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 602px;","style":"width: 592px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 5-20240812174255-lx4mug0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 592px;\" parent-style=\"width: 602px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 568px;","style":"width: 558px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 7-20240812174708-uu9waf7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 558px;\" parent-style=\"width: 568px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812174219-ykvktq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812174219-ykvktq9","updated":"20240812174420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 597px;","style":"width: 587px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 4-20240812174219-rv2xc8z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 587px;\" parent-style=\"width: 597px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 596px;","style":"width: 586px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 6-20240812174420-3chse4k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 586px;\" parent-style=\"width: 596px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240621144957-qsoz9yb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621144957-qsoz9yb","updated":"20240812174122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 791px;","style":"width: 781px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜花2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜花2-20240621145134-jconwjj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 781px;\" parent-style=\"width: 791px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 3-20240812174122-769dw9q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812174909-0e9ccp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812174909-0e9ccp4","updated":"20240812175104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 431px;","style":"width: 421px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 8-20240812174909-w6ul693.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 421px;\" parent-style=\"width: 431px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 759px;","style":"width: 749px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 10-20240812175104-evlbw79.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 749px;\" parent-style=\"width: 759px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812173556-aydkh21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812173556-aydkh21","updated":"20240812173632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 622px;","style":"width: 612px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜叶2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜叶2-20240621145321-dg0fzkp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 612px;\" parent-style=\"width: 622px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 620px;","style":"width: 610px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 9-20240812175032-kynvbq4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 610px;\" parent-style=\"width: 620px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240812175229-iznckw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812175229-iznckw4","updated":"20240812175329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 13-20240812175329-ixj67o8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 842px;","style":"width: 832px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"甜瓜 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/甜瓜 11-20240812175229-8ihqhnp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 832px;\" parent-style=\"width: 842px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611111044-x0vxrs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111044-x0vxrs8","updated":"20240621144254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：瓜蒂为甜瓜的果蒂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111044-hydjcca","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611111044-hydjcca"}},{"ID":"20240611111049-qez53q3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111049-qez53q3","updated":"20240611111054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111049-3tuqsci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111049-3tuqsci","updated":"20240611111049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111049-7tfjafs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111049-7tfjafs","updated":"20240611111049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主大水身面四肝浮肿，下水，杀蛊毒，咳逆上气，及食诸果，病在胸腹中，皆吐下之。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111049-prpmg9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111049-prpmg9z","updated":"20240611111049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生蒿高，七月七日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111049-volvhqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111049-volvhqb","updated":"20240611111049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：瓜，（瓜瓜）也，象形。蒂，瓜当也。《广雅》云：水芝，瓜也。陶宏景云：甜瓜蒂也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111111-wdlf08y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611111111-wdlf08y"}},{"ID":"20240611111112-fz0kbpp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-fz0kbpp","updated":"20240611111119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111112-au54cts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-au54cts","updated":"20240611111112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，有毒。主大水，身面、四肢浮肿，下水，杀蛊毒，咳逆上气，及食诸果病在胸腹中，皆吐下之。去鼻中息肉，疗黄胆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111112-gw7h73j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-gw7h73j","updated":"20240611111112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"花"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主心痛，咳逆。生嵩高平泽。七月七日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111112-ky09tts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-ky09tts","updated":"20240611111112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶瓜蒂，多用早青蒂，此云七月采，便是甜瓜蒂也。人亦有用熟瓜蒂者，取吐乃无异，此只于论其蒂所主尔。今瓜例皆冷利，早青者尤甚。熟瓜乃有数种，除瓤食之不害人，若觉多，即入水自渍便即消。永嘉有寒瓜甚大，今每取藏经年食之。亦有再熟瓜，又有越瓜，人作菹食之，亦冷，并非药用尔。今注甜瓜有青、白二种，入药当用青瓜蒂。前条白瓜子，唐注云甘瓜子，入腹内结聚，破溃脓血，最为肠胃脾内壅要药，正是此甜瓜子之功。前条便以白瓜子为甘瓜子，非也。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶瓜蒂，使。茎主鼻中息肉， 鼻。和小豆、丁香吹鼻，治黄。日华子云∶无毒。治脑塞，热 ，眼昏，吐痰。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111112-9eoermg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-9eoermg","updated":"20240611111112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶瓜蒂，即甜瓜蒂也。生嵩高平泽，今处处有之，亦园圃所莳。旧说瓜有青、白二种，入药当用青瓜蒂，七月采，阴干。方∶书所用，多入吹鼻及吐膈散中。茎亦主鼻中息肉，鼻等。叶主无发，捣汁涂之即生。花主心痛，咳逆。肉主烦渴，除热，多食则动痼疾。又有越瓜黄色，亦谓之黄瓜，别无功用，食之亦不益人，故可略之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111112-5nk8rpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-5nk8rpt","updated":"20240611111112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公凡使，勿用白瓜蒂，要采取青绿色瓜，待瓜气足，其瓜蒂自然落在蔓茎上。采得未用时，使榔榔叶裹，于东墙有风处，挂令吹干用。瓜子，凡使，勿用瓜子实，恐误。采得后，便于日中暴令内外干，便杵，用马尾筛筛过，成粉末了用。其药不出油，其效力短。若要出油，生杵作膏，用三重纸裹，用重物覆压之，取无油用。食疗瓜蒂，主身面、四肢浮肿，杀蛊，去鼻中息肉，阴黄黄胆及暴急黄。取瓜蒂、丁香各七枚，小豆七粒，为末，吹黑豆许于鼻中，少时黄水出，瘥。其子，热。补中，宜人。瓜有毒。止渴，益气，除烦热，利小便，通三焦壅塞气。多食令人阴下湿痒，生疮。动宿冷病。症癖人不可食之。若食之饱胀，入水自消。多食令人 虚弱，脚手无力。叶生捣汁生发。又，补中，打损折，碾末酒服去瘀血，治小儿疳。《龙鱼河图》云∶瓜有两鼻者杀人；沉水者杀人；食多腹胀，可食盐，花成水。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111112-epe5k6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-epe5k6g","updated":"20240611111112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"圣惠方∶治时气，三日处忽觉心满坚硬，脚手心热，变黄，不治杀人。以瓜蒂七枚杵末，如大豆许吹两鼻中，令黄水出，残末水调服之，得吐黄水一、二升，瘥。又方∶治鼻中息肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111112-p8snghu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-p8snghu","updated":"20240611111112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少许，敷息肉上，日三。经验方∶治遍身如金色。瓜蒂四十九个，须四十九个，用甘锅子烧烟尽为度，细研为末。小儿用半字，吹鼻内及揩牙治大人、小儿久患风痫，缠喉风， 嗽，遍身风疹，急中涎潮等。此药不大吐逆，只出涎水。小儿服一字，瓜蒂不限多少，细碾为末，壮年半字，早晨井花水下。一食顷，含沙糖一块。良久涎如水出，年深涎尽，有一块如涎布，水上如鉴矣。涎尽食粥一、两日。如吐多困甚，即咽麝香汤一盏，即止矣。麝细研，温水调下。昔天平尚书觉昏眩，即服之取涎，有效。伤寒类要∶治急黄，心上坚硬，渴欲得水吃，气息喘粗，眼黄。但有一候相当，则以瓜蒂二小合，熬赤小豆二合，为末一炊久当吐，不吐再服五分匕，亦减之。若吹鼻中，两、三黑豆许，黄水出歇。又方∶治黄胆，目黄不除。瓜丁散∶瓜丁细末，如大豆许纳鼻中。令病患衍义曰∶瓜蒂，此即甜瓜蒂也。去瓜皮，用蒂，约半寸许，曝极干，不限多少，为细末。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111112-nl89ko4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111112-nl89ko4","updated":"20240611111112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"量疾，每用一、二钱匕，腻粉一钱匕，以水半协议调匀，灌之，治风涎暴作，气塞倒卧。服之，用诸药行化不下，但如此服，涎即出。或服药良久涎未出，含沙糖一块，下咽即涎出。此物甚不损人，全胜石碌、 砂辈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111124-gquszow","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611111124-gquszow"}},{"ID":"20240611111125-a2hu2dx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111125-a2hu2dx","updated":"20240611111132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111125-rq9kufa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111125-rq9kufa","updated":"20240611111125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名瓜丁．宣、涌吐．"}]},{"ID":"20240611111125-rka1cqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111125-rka1cqu","updated":"20240611111125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒．有小毒．阳明（胃．）吐药．能吐风热痰涎．上膈宿食．（吐去上焦之邪、经所谓其高者、因而越之、在上者涌之、木郁达之是也、瓜蒂散、越以瓜蒂淡豉之苦、涌以赤小豆之酸、吐去上焦有形之物、则木得舒畅、天地交而万物通矣、丹溪曰∶吐中就有发散之义、子和曰∶诸汗法、古方多有之、唯以吐发汗、世罕知之、故予尝曰∶吐法兼汗、其以此夫．）治风眩头痛．懊 不眠．癫痫喉痹．上脘痞硬．头目湿气．（ 鼻．）水肿黄胆．（或合赤小豆煎、或吹鼻中、取出黄水．）湿热诸病．（类编云∶一女子病 喘不止、遇道人、教取瓜蒂七胶粘、三进而病如扫．凡取吐者、须天气清明、巳午以前行之、令病患隔夜勿食、卒病者不拘．）损胃伤血．耗气夺神．上部无实邪者．切勿轻投．（当吐而胃弱者、代以参芦．）甜瓜（俗名熟瓜．）性冷．有小毒．损阳．（虽能解暑、然夏多食之、深秋未有不下痢者．凡瓜皆冷利、早青尤甚．）瓜叶、无发．捣汁涂之．即生．"}]},{"ID":"20240611111138-ask2cwf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611111138-ask2cwf"}},{"ID":"20240611111139-12efv7n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111139-12efv7n","updated":"20240611111147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111139-h39gkcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111139-h39gkcg","updated":"20240611111139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂，味苦，性寒，有小毒。凡邪在上焦，致头目、四肢、面上浮肿，与胸中积滞，并下部有脉、上部无脉者，皆宜用瓜蒂以吐之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111139-6ulz4eg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111139-6ulz4eg","updated":"20240611111139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问瓜蒂可疗黄胆，吾子略而不言，何也？夫黄胆之症，多从下受，用瓜蒂吐之，是从上疗之也，似乎相宜。然而，黄胆乃湿热壅于上、中、下三焦，下病而止治上，将居中焦于不问乎，此瓜蒂不可治黄胆亦明矣。余所以作缺疑之论矣也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111139-vhzm5mj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111139-vhzm5mj","updated":"20240611111139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问瓜蒂能去鼻中息肉，子亦不论，是何说乎？曰∶鼻中生息肉者，因肺中之热也。用瓜蒂以吐去痰涎，则肺热除，而鼻火亦泄，似乎相宜。然而，肺热虽移热于鼻，上吐以泄鼻中之火，势必中伤肺中之气。肺气既伤，胃气自逆，肺心反动其火，火动鼻中，更添热气，前之息肉未消，而后之息肉又长矣，予所以削而不道也。至于瓜蒂性易上涌，不宜轻用，不独鼻中生息肉也。若胸中无寒，胃家无食，皮中无水，心中无邪，以致诸虚各症，均宜慎用。误用则祸不旋踵矣也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111152-u8v5f1x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611111152-u8v5f1x"}},{"ID":"20240611111153-yc4kg8i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111153-yc4kg8i","updated":"20240611111157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111153-pf0d3od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111153-pf0d3od","updated":"20240611111153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒通于胃腑．吐膈上蓄聚之热痰．研散纳之鼻中．治头内蕴留之水湿．（瓜蒂即甜瓜蒂．以色青味甜．可供果馔者为佳．待瓜熟后．取蒂连柄半寸许．曝干用之．味苦性寒．入肺胃．功专消水化热．治黄瘅．杀虫毒．其极苦之性．能降能涌．所谓在上者因而越之．在下者引而竭之之义．各因其病而利导．但其性甚紧．善引吐．为瞑眩之药．非上焦有风痰实热水蓄等证．不可用之．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611111202-saucd4b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611111202-saucd4b"}},{"ID":"20240611111203-sbe06hx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111203-sbe06hx","updated":"20240611111207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111203-gflynr1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111203-gflynr1","updated":"20240611111203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气寒，味苦。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111203-15t6mvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111203-15t6mvd","updated":"20240611111203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶治大水，身面四肢浮肿，下水，杀蛊毒。咳逆上气，及食诸果，病在胸腹中者，皆吐下之。去鼻中息肉，疗黄胆，鼻中出黄水。除偏头疼，有神，头目有湿，宜此。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111203-idf7r5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111203-idf7r5r","updated":"20240611111203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂苦，以治胸中寒，与白虎同例，俱见知母条下。与麝香、细辛为使。治久不闻香臭。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111203-23trzkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111203-23trzkc","updated":"20240611111203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仲景钤方∶瓜蒂一十四个，丁香一个，黍米四十九粒，为末，含水 一字，取下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111211-syxoj7r","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611111211-syxoj7r"}},{"ID":"20240611111212-p9o7b91","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111212-p9o7b91","updated":"20240611111218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111212-wrteqls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111212-wrteqls","updated":"20240611111212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒．有小毒．入足阳明经．功专引吐．得淡豆豉、赤小豆吐中有散．叶捣汁涂头生发．偏头痛以瓜蒂晒干生研末．纳鼻中出黄水即愈．甜瓜蒂也．"}]},{"ID":"20240611111059-b18g7zn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611111059-b18g7zn"}},{"ID":"20240611111100-kvvmi2g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111100-kvvmi2g","updated":"20240611111105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《药征》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111100-wmcx3r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111100-wmcx3r1","updated":"20240611111100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治胸中有毒，欲吐而不吐也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111100-ifkhvt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111100-ifkhvt7","updated":"20240611111100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【考证】"}]},{"ID":"20240611111100-xrhqoy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111100-xrhqoy0","updated":"20240611111100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂散证曰∶胸中痞硬、气上冲咽喉、不得息者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111100-tlc1rwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111100-tlc1rwq","updated":"20240611111100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又曰∶心中满而烦、饥而不能食者，病在胸中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111100-4mnl1nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111100-4mnl1nr","updated":"20240611111100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上一方，瓜蒂一分。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111100-halxj4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111100-halxj4h","updated":"20240611111100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【品考】"}]},{"ID":"20240611111100-zeokjl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111100-zeokjl7","updated":"20240611111100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂 宗 、时珍，以为甜瓜蒂。试之，无寸效也。又有一种，名柿瓜。其种殊少，而其形如柿。又有一种，如柿瓜而皮上有毛者，其始皆太苦，而不可食也。及熟，则尤甜美，其蒂甚苦，有效可用。三才图会，所谓青瓜也，本邦越前之产，是为良也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110225-wx0jm93","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611110225-wx0jm93"}},{"ID":"20240611111036-9lce6xb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111036-9lce6xb","updated":"20240611111042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111036-3053xan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111036-3053xan","updated":"20240611111036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】味苦寒。主大水身面四肢浮肿，下水，杀蛊毒，咳逆上气，及食诸果，病在胸腹中，皆吐下之。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111036-h8dcn7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111036-h8dcn7h","updated":"20240611111036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，性寒，入足阳明胃、足太阴脾经。利水而泻湿淫，行瘀而涌腐败。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111036-i19ifm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111036-i19ifm9","updated":"20240611111036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《伤寒》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒂汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒂二十枚。水一升，煎五合，顿服之。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治太阳中暍，身热痛重，而脉微弱。以夏月汗出，浴于冷水，水入汗孔，而行皮中。窍隧冷闭，郁遏阳火，而生内热。壮火伤气，故脉微弱。瓜蒂决皮中之水，开窍而泻热也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111036-8vvye68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111036-8vvye68","updated":"20240611111036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒂散"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒂一分，赤小豆一分。为散，取一钱匕，以香豉一合，用热汤煮作稀糜，去滓，取汁和散，温服取吐。不吐，加之，得快吐乃止。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治胸有寒瘀，病如桂枝证，头不痛，项不强，寸脉微浮，心中痞硬，气上冲咽喉，不得息者。以胃土上逆，碍胆经降路，二气相迫，结于胃口，故心下痞硬。降路梗塞，则肺气逆冲，咽喉阻闭。肺气郁遏淫蒸，而化痰涎，隧道皆填。是以胸膈壅闷，不得喘息。小豆、香豉，行其瘀浊，瓜蒂涌其痰涎也。治厥阴病，邪结胸中，心下烦，饥不能食，手足厥冷，脉乍紧者。以痰涎在胸，郁阻肺气，不能四达，瓜蒂涌痰涎以通气道也。治宿食在上脘者。宿食上停，浊气不降，郁闷懊憹，头痛发热，其状甚似外感，瓜蒂涌之，则浊降而病除也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111036-nqginvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111036-nqginvu","updated":"20240611111036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂苦寒，泻水涤痰，涌吐腐败，以清气道，荡宿食停饮，消水肿黄疸，通脑闷鼻鼽，止咳逆齁喘。湿热头痛，风涎喉阻。一切癫痫蛊胀之病皆医。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111036-h7ng1nm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111036-h7ng1nm","updated":"20240611111036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亡血家忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110413-37pn5x7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611110413-37pn5x7"}},{"ID":"20240611111026-1sbagbc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611111026-1sbagbc","updated":"20240611111031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611111026-92l7lop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111026-92l7lop","updated":"20240611111026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂苦寒能吐痰，风痫喉痹不须探，果积蛊毒心腹胀，咳逆浮疽鼻息拈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611111026-17orvsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611111026-17orvsr","updated":"20240611111026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡蔓生者为瓜，此甜瓜蒂也。有毒。善吐。凡风痰暴塞胸膈，头眩喉风，风痫风疹，咳逆上气，及诸果积蛊毒，病在胸中，皆吐下之。治黄胆及暴水肿，和赤小豆、丁香为末，吹鼻中，少时黄水自出，亦可服方寸匕。治鼻中 肉，为末，羊脂调少许敷之。青绿者佳，水煮去皮，麸炒黄色。花主心痛咳逆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110413-r1iz90p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611110413-r1iz90p"}},{"ID":"20240611110931-n0gzo0j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611110931-n0gzo0j","updated":"20240611110940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-hpyzgr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-hpyzgr7","updated":"20240611110943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即甜瓜蒂。瓜类不同，一曰果瓜，西瓜、甜瓜是也。一曰菜瓜，胡瓜、越瓜是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-6ufzruu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-6ufzruu","updated":"20240611110949"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甜瓜南北种莳甚多，其类最繁。有团有长，有尖有扁，大或径尺，小或一捻，其棱或有或无，其色或青或绿，或黄斑糁斑，或白路黄路。入药用瓜之团而短者良，若长如瓠子不可用。（濒湖）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-6ihmgtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-6ihmgtx","updated":"20240611110925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，气寒，有小毒。气薄味厚，浮而升，阴多于阳。（酸苦涌泄为阴）入手太阴足阳明太阴经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-yupv6z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-yupv6z7","updated":"20240611110945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主水气身面浮肿，咳逆上气。并湿气上侵作偏头痛，吐风热痰涎，暴塞咽膈，风眩头痛，疗黄疸急黄喘息。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-iww8ndz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-iww8ndz","updated":"20240611110947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜实在须蔓间，（其字象形）蒂则瓜之缀蔓处，性偏延蔓，末繁于本。故近本之瓜尝小，近末之瓜转大。凡实之吮抽水液，惟瓜称最，而吮抽之枢，抵当惟蒂而已。是以蒂具彻下炎上之用，蒂味苦而瓜本甘，以见中枢之别于上下内外，诚涌泄之宣剂通剂也。（之颐）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-hlmpq38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-hlmpq38","updated":"20240611110951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂主治，皆取其宣发涌泄，引涎越积之功。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-ce8x611","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-ce8x611","updated":"20240611110925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂乃阳明经除湿热之药，能引出胸脘痰涎，头目湿气，皮肤水气，黄疸湿热诸证。（濒湖）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-2bbvgjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-2bbvgjs","updated":"20240611110925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"纳鼻中，出黄水，除偏头痛有神，因湿者宜此。（海藏）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-33q51qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-33q51qj","updated":"20240611110953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"偏头痛，是湿气所干，气虚偏右，血虚偏左。瓜蒂末纳鼻出黄水，导湿气下流也。（《类明》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-q4hjhou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-q4hjhou","updated":"20240611110954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《难经》云：上部有脉，下部无脉，其人当吐不吐者，死，用瓜蒂散。若尺脉绝者，不宜用此，恐损真元，令人胃气不复也。（东垣）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-enhayu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-enhayu3","updated":"20240617115548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仲景云：病如桂枝证，头不痛，项不强，寸脉微浮，胸中痞硬，气上冲咽喉不得息者，此胸中有寒也，当吐之。太阳中暍，身热头痛而脉微弱，此夏月伤冷水，水行皮中也，宜吐之。少阳病头痛，发寒热，脉紧不大，是膈上有痰也，宜吐之。病胸上诸实，郁郁而痛不能食，欲人按之而反有浊唾，下利日十余行，寸口脉微弦者，当吐之。懊憹烦躁不得眠，未经汗下者，谓之实烦，当吐之。宿食在上脘者，当吐之，并宜瓜蒂散。惟亡血虚家，不可与。用瓜蒂二钱半，熬黄，赤小豆二钱半，为末，每用一钱，以香豉一合，热汤七合煮糜。去渣和服，少少加之，快吐乃止。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-4m4gke7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-4m4gke7","updated":"20240611110925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高者越之，在上者涌之，故越以瓜蒂、香豉之苦，涌以赤小豆之酸，酸苦涌泄为阴也。（无己）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-8puo6qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-8puo6qk","updated":"20240611110959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身面浮肿，并取瓜蒂丁香赤小豆各七枚，为末。吹豆许入鼻，少时黄水流出，隔日一用，瘥乃止。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-c0g20as","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-c0g20as","updated":"20240611110925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"湿家头痛，瓜蒂末一字，搐鼻，口含冷水，取出黄水愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-5v07ruk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-5v07ruk","updated":"20240611110925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风涎暴作，气塞倒仆。瓜蒂为末，每用一二钱，腻粉一钱匕，以水半合调灌，良久涎自出。不出，含沙糖一块，下咽即出。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-bpzme0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-bpzme0j","updated":"20240611111003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸风膈痰，诸痫涎涌。用瓜蒂炒黄为末，量人以酸齑水一盏调下，取吐。风痫，加蝎梢半钱。湿气肿满，加赤小豆末一钱。有虫，加狗油五七点，雄黄一钱，甚则加芫花五分，立吐虫出。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-p8xdo10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-p8xdo10","updated":"20240611111005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕用蒂，须取甜瓜。蒂味苦而瓜味甘，舍甘用苦，以苦能达甘之用也。甜瓜吐华五六月，禀火之气以致于土，其色黄，自吐华即有蒂，而实即结于蒂。故蒂禀火气，瓜味甘，蒂之苦即联于甘，故禀火气以致土，即所谓以苦而达甘之用也。夫甘之用，不止达水以至土，必先达水以至火。此以二月下种，蔓延末大，厚孕于水气，至夏火毕达而实乃成。火之毕达者，正水之必达也，此彻下炎上之用，所以致土用也。夫土兼四气，而以水火为中气之元，至于水火毕达，则土之用得际于极上，胃气之至于肺以布四脏者，皆由此也。（是以治证多灌入鼻中）即是以思治疗之功，如火能达，则风热之为患者散，水能达，则湿寒之为患者亦散。至湿热黄疸，是病于土之体也，土用达，又何不达之有，诚涌泄之宣剂通剂哉。但达土用者无如此，为土病者亦即在此，故胃弱人忌之。嘉谟云：代以参芦可也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-ug37llb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-ug37llb","updated":"20240611110925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性急能损胃气，胃弱者切忌。病后产后，尤宜深戒。（丹溪）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110925-tsj9wru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110925-tsj9wru","updated":"20240611110925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味极苦而性上涌，能损胃伤血，耗气损神，切勿误用，为害非细。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110225-kno7csc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611110225-kno7csc"}},{"ID":"20240611110357-0l3pi1d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611110357-0l3pi1d","updated":"20240611110410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611110357-lgndivg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110357-lgndivg","updated":"20240611110357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒，有毒，主治大水，身面四肢浮肿，下水，杀蛊毒，咳逆上气，及食诸果，病在胸腹中，皆吐下之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110357-aobrkym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110357-aobrkym","updated":"20240611110357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（ 今作蒂，反蒂一名苦丁香，乃甜瓜蒂也。《别录》云∶瓜蒂生蒿高平泽，七月七日采，阴干。今则甜瓜一种，北土中州处处皆莳植矣。三月下种，延蔓而生叶，大数寸，五六月开黄花，六七月瓜熟，其类最繁，有圆有长，有尖有扁，大或径尺，小或一捻，或有棱，或无棱，或色或青、或绿、或黄斑、或糁斑、或白路、或黄路、其瓤或白或红，其子或黄或赤，或白或黑。《王祯农书》云∶瓜品甚多，不可枚举，以状得名者，有龙肝、虎掌、兔头、狸首、羊髓、蜜筒之称。以色得名者，有乌瓜、白团、黄 、白 、小青、大斑之别。然其味不出乎香甜而已，雷 曰∶凡使勿用白瓜蒂，要取青绿色，瓜气足时，其蒂自然落在蔓上者，采得系屋东有风处吹干用。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110357-m3l0prm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110357-m3l0prm","updated":"20240611110357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（今浙中之香瓜即甜瓜也。诸瓜之中唯此瓜最甜，故名甜瓜。亦唯此瓜有香，故谓之香瓜，余瓜不尔也。今人治黄胆初起，取其蒂烧灰存性，用少许吸鼻中，流出黄水而愈，极验。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110357-e3tqwax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110357-e3tqwax","updated":"20240611110357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甜瓜生于嵩高平泽，味甘，臭香，色黄。盖禀天地中央之正气，其瓜极甜，其蒂极苦，合火土相生之气化，故主治大水，及身面四肢浮肿。所以然者，禀火土之气，达于四旁，而能制化其水湿，故又曰∶下水。土气营运，故杀蛊毒。苦主下泄，故治咳逆上气。苦能上涌，又主下泄，故食诸果病在胸腹中者，皆可吐下之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110357-iqf346a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110357-iqf346a","updated":"20240611110403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"愚按∶苦为阴，甘为阳，此系蔓草，性唯上延，以极苦之蒂，生极甜之瓜，直从下而上，从金匮方作为吐剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110306-66xez1s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611110306-66xez1s"}},{"ID":"20240611110340-vkua57w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611110340-vkua57w","updated":"20240611110345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611110340-7hwwqc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110340-7hwwqc2","updated":"20240611110340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，有毒。主大水，身面四肢浮肿，下水，杀蛊毒，咳逆上气，食诸果不消，病在胸腹中，皆吐下之。去鼻中息肉，疗黄胆。其花，主心痛，咳逆。生嵩高平泽，七月七日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110340-a6jk60e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110340-a6jk60e","updated":"20240611110340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂多用早青蒂，此云七月七日采，便是甜瓜蒂也。人亦有用熟瓜蒂者，取吐乃无异，此止论其蒂所主耳。今瓜例皆冷利，早青者尤甚。熟瓜乃有数种，除瓤食不害人，若觉食多，入瓜甚大，今每即取藏经年食之。亦有再熟瓜，又有越瓜，人以作菹者，食之亦冷，并非药用耳。《博物志》云∶水浸至项，食瓜无数。又云斑瓜花有毒，分采之，瓜皮杀 虫也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110254-8txj4nf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611110254-8txj4nf"}},{"ID":"20240611110259-36l7gat","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-36l7gat","updated":"20240611110304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-lmk6rup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-lmk6rup","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【科属与药用部分】本品为葫芦科植物甜瓜的果柄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-71wi9wi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-71wi9wi","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】苦，寒。有小毒。入胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-2p0towc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-2p0towc","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】涌吐痰食。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-iigzfyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-iigzfyr","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于痰涎雍盛，宿食停聚等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-cdyppq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-cdyppq7","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瓜蒂苦寒有毒，用于痰涎、宿食停聚胃中而宜于涌吐者，用本品与赤小豆为末，香鼓煮汁，温服以催吐。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-lk8fhzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-lk8fhzy","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，本品研末搐鼻，有退黄疸的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-eh7l4rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-eh7l4rt","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】瓜蒂、苦丁香（洗净，晒干用）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-ri6tu0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-ri6tu0t","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一分至三分，宜作散剂。本品有毒，用量不可过大。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-afeb3w7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-afeb3w7","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】瓜蒂散《金匮要略》：瓜蒂、赤小豆。治胸痞，上脘有宿食者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-k3teh5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-k3teh5o","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「咳逆上气，及食诸果，病在胸腹中，皆吐下之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-hkl1u0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-hkl1u0k","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《别录》：「疗黄疸。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-x9jz85m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-x9jz85m","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：「吐风热痰涎，治风眩头痛，癫痫喉痹，头目有湿气。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611110259-jtnta4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110259-jtnta4k","updated":"20240611110259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草便读》：「苦寒通于胃腑，吐隔上蓄聚之热痰。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611110225-lmcl96u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611110225-lmcl96u"}},{"ID":"20240611110249-vw0sca6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-vw0sca6","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：瓜蒂"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-61e27xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-61e27xd","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-hx8dmbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-hx8dmbx","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Guā Dì"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-4yg0h29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-4yg0h29","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-v2uln94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-v2uln94","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦丁香、甜瓜蒂、香瓜蒂"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-mlaxer0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-mlaxer0","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-n451nwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-n451nwt","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为葫芦科甜瓜属植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"甜瓜"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cucumis melo L.的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"果梗"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，其"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"种子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也作药用。甜瓜盛产期，剪取青绿色瓜蒂阴干即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-k350yzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-k350yzd","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-wvtfwyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-wvtfwyi","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，寒。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-2n0qylj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-2n0qylj","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-4h7mugq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-4h7mugq","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 体弱及有心脏病者忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-u4rsu10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-u4rsu10","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-im974ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-im974ne","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 催吐，退黄疸。用于食积不化，食物中毒，癫痫痰盛；外用治急、慢性肝炎，肝硬化。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-wbsfgj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-wbsfgj1","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-6d4zlbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-6d4zlbm","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 2～5分，制成散剂，内服催吐；外用适量，纳鼻孔中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-kekmx2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-kekmx2s","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-buqyoxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-buqyoxb","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-kavvg91","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-kavvg91","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：瓜蒂"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-1hyvftz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-1hyvftz","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-rqffx3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-rqffx3h","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Guā Dì"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-iwm98b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-iwm98b7","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-23wg3v8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-23wg3v8","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甜瓜蒂（陶弘景），瓜丁（《千金翼方》），苦丁香（《本草衍义补遗》），甜瓜把（《山东中药》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-pm57tws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-pm57tws","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-4lncig4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-4lncig4","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-sz2rddf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-sz2rddf","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-f3ei8yn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-f3ei8yn","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为葫芦科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"甜瓜"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"果蒂"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。6～7月间，采摘尚未老熟的果实，切取果蒂，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-ahveied","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-ahveied","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-mdnxa65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-mdnxa65","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国大部地区均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-9uzgq2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-9uzgq2u","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-a9xmalm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-a9xmalm","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的果蒂，其果柄略弯曲，上有纵棱，微皱缩；连接果实的一端渐膨大，即花萼的残基。表面黄褐色，有时带有卷曲的果皮。质柔韧，不易折断。气微，味苦。以干燥、色黄、稍带果柄者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-v92w06b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-v92w06b","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-d5svncx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-d5svncx","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蒂含喷瓜素。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-yyt14ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-yyt14ce","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-mhefmqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-mhefmqv","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 对胃肠道的影响。实验动物内服甜瓜素Melotoxin后，有呕吐及下痢的症状，但皮下或静脉注射时则无反应。因此甜瓜素刺激胃感觉神经后，反射地兴奋呕吐中枢而引起上述症状。有谓甜瓜根可作催吐或利尿剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-p0f4189","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-p0f4189","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-0zjs68q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-0zjs68q","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-rtrk7hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-rtrk7hq","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"入手太阴，足阳明、太阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-6zbtf41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-6zbtf41","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇言》：\"入手、足阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-fy1qzss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-fy1qzss","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入心、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-3k3eghd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-3k3eghd","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-1ayfhq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-1ayfhq8","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-y1rp4eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-y1rp4eq","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-4yzitpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-4yzitpo","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-6yp0d73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-6yp0d73","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-zpbx5g2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-zpbx5g2","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 体虚、失血及上部无实邪者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-qw4lmhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-qw4lmhu","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《伤寒论》：\"诸亡血、虚家，不可与。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-3uucon5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-3uucon5","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草衍义补遗》：\"胃弱者勿用。病后，产后宜深戒之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-cdsk8wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-cdsk8wp","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-jqbu9kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-jqbu9kj","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 吐风痰宿食，泻水湿停饮。治痰涎宿食，壅塞上脘，胸中痞梗，风痰癫痫，湿热黄疸，四肢浮肿，鼻塞，喉痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-nzqwwwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-nzqwwwm","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主大水，身面四肢浮肿，下水，杀蛊毒，咳逆上气，及食诸果，病在胸腹中，皆吐下之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-bywxvlt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-bywxvlt","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"去鼻中息肉，疗黄疸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-0yxto6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-0yxto6b","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"治脑塞热齆，眼昏，吐痰。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-ejoulmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-ejoulmg","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"吐风热痰涎。治风眩、头痛、癫痫，喉痹，头面有湿气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-gar5qt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-gar5qt2","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草再新》：\"泻心火，健脾土，利湿消水，止头痛衄血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-jaod81m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-jaod81m","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-v8lmn8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-v8lmn8x","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0.8～1.5钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末搐鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-sjto2z2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-sjto2z2","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-j3j6ao6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-j3j6ao6","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治病如桂枝证，头不痛，项不强，寸脉微浮，胸中痞粳，气上冲咽喉，不得息者，此为胸中有寒也，当吐之：瓜蒂一分（熬黄），赤小豆一分。上二味，各别捣筛，为散已，合治之，取-钱匕，以香豉一合，用热汤七合，煮作稀糜，去滓，取汁和散，温顿服之，不吐者，少少加，得快吐乃止。（《伤寒论》瓜蒂散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-m5dh6cw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-m5dh6cw","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治风涎暴作，气塞倒卧：甜瓜蒂（曝极干），不限多少，为细末。量疾，每用一、二钱匕：腻粉一钱匕，以水半合同调匀，灌之。服之良久，涎自出，或涎未出，含砂糖一块，下咽，涎即出。（《本草衍义》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-3h29kmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-3h29kmh","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治诸风膈痰，诸痫涎涌：瓜蒂炒黄为末，量人以酸薤水一盏调下，取吐。（《活法机要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-66pjptx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-66pjptx","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治风痢、缠喉风、咳嗽、遍身风疹、急中涎潮：瓜蒂不限多少，细碾为末，壮年一字，十五（岁）以下及老怯半字，早晨井花水下，一食顷，含砂糖一块，良久涎如水出；年深，涎尽有一块如涎，布水上如鉴矣。涎尽，食粥一、两日。如吐多困甚，咽麝香汤一盏即止矣。麝细研温水调下。（《经验后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-8eqryah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-8eqryah","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治发狂欲走：瓜蒂末，井水服一钱，取吐。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-2a507wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-2a507wa","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治齁喘痰气：苦丁香三个为末，水调服，吐痰即止。（《朱氏集验医方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-u5d3qc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-u5d3qc3","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治太阳中暍，身热疼重而脉微弱，此以夏月伤冷水，水行皮中所致。又治诸黄：瓜蒂二七个，锉，以水一升，煮取五合，去渣顿服。（《金匮要略》一物瓜蒂汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-sfukera","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-sfukera","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治黄疸目黄不除：瓜丁细末如一大豆许，内鼻中，令病人深吸取入，鼻中黄水出。（《千金翼方》瓜丁散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-r80aaib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-r80aaib","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治癊黄黄疸及暴急黄：瓜蒂、丁香各七枚，小豆七粒。为末，吹黑豆许刁：鼻中，少时黄水出。（《食疗本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-rz5vbdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-rz5vbdo","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治湿家，头中寒湿，头疼鼻塞而烦者：瓜蒂末，口含水，搐一字许入鼻中，出黄水。（《类证活人书》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-liveere","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-liveere","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治鼻中息肉：陈瓜蒂一分，捣罗为末，以羊脂和，以少许敷息肉上，日三用之。（《圣惠方》瓜蒂膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-myqzwyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-myqzwyu","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治牙齿痛：瓜蒂七枚，炒黄碾散，以麝香相和，新绵裹，病牙处咬之。（《圣济总录》瓜蒂散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-s10lj20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-s10lj20","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治疟，无问新久：瓜蒂二七枚，捣，水渍一宿服之。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-pq4rwk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-pq4rwk0","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-0u4d0yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-0u4d0yj","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗急性黄痘型传染性肝炎:㈠口服法：取未成熟的甜瓜蒂6克（干品），装入小口瓶内，加开水100毫升，浸10分钟后加热，待瓶口微微出气约3～4分钟，即将瓶口塞紧；10天后取出过滤3～4次，经高压灭菌3～4小时（借以减少副作用）后始可服用。每日2～3次食后服，10个月至3岁小儿每次1毫升，4～12岁2毫升，成人5毫升。或用生瓜蒂50克，玄胡650克，公丁香350克，共研细末，加入白糖350克，淀粉200克，葡萄糖500克，混合制成蜜丸（每丸含瓜蒂25毫克）。日服2次，每次半丸。小儿酌减。㈡鼻腔吸入法：将在7、8月间剪下之瓜蒂把阴干，用文火焙黄，研粉分包，每包0.1～0.15克。用时取1包分成4～6等分，于晨起空腹时每隔20～30分钟从两鼻孔各吸入一等分，经40分钟至1小时许鼻腔便流出黄色分泌液，每隔5～7天（视体质情况）用l包，4包为一疗程。吸入深度以至中鼻道为宜；如吸得过深，会引起上呼吸道刺激症状，个别还可能产生发热。吸药时宜取俯卧、侧卧或坐位。临床共治151例，除年老体弱及小儿单用瓜蒂液或丸口服外，其余均并用鼻腔吸入法；重症患者加用其它中药、静脉输液等。结果治愈（症状消失，肝脾回缩至正常或稳定，肝功能复查2次完全恢复正常）者占93.33％，好转（症状明显减轻，肝功能好转）者占6.67％。平均治愈日数34.77天。普遍在吸药1～2次后食欲增进，黄疸消退；一般吸药3～5次（平均3.17次）即可治愈，计：食欲增加平均6.43天，肝脾回缩正常23.29天，肝功能恢复正常（黄疸指数11.88天，转氨酶及其它项目25.63天），副作用：吸入后鼻粘膜易干燥，有时可引起少量鼻血，另有单用瓜蒂液口服观察103例，结果在10天内治愈昔占46.6％，15天内治愈者达92.2％；肝肿恢复至肋缘下1.5厘米以内，在30天内者占35.92％，在40天内者占97.09％；黄疸在5天内消失者占70.87％，10天内消失者为95.14％；尿三胆试验阳性及肝功能异常的病例，治疗后全部恢复正常。追踪观察1～2年未发现肝硬化或死亡病例。治疗中未见副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-enn2cs8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-enn2cs8","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611110249-ydsx6nb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110249-ydsx6nb","updated":"20240611110249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611110250-l4zeea7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611110250-l4zeea7"}},{"ID":"20240611110251-y88jz96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611110251-y88jz96"}}]}